        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Calculate <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 10\\div 5^0 + (3^2-5).]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Calculate [MATH: 10\\div 5^0 + (3^2-5).]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>To evaluate the given expression, we use PEMDAS.</p><p>First, we compute the expression inside the parentheses:</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: 10 \u00f7 5^{0} + (9 \u2212 5) = 10 \u00f7 5^{0} + 4]</span></p><p>Next, notice that <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 5^0=1.]</span> So, we obtain:</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: 10 \u00f7 5^{0} + 4|=; 10 \u00f7 1 + 4|=; 10 + 4|=; 14]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "To evaluate the given expression, we use PEMDAS.\n\nFirst, we compute the expression inside the parentheses:\n\n[MATH: 10 \u00f7 5^{0} + (9 \u2212 5) = 10 \u00f7 5^{0} + 4]\n\nNext, notice that [MATH: 5^0=1.] So, we obtain:\n\n[MATH: 10 \u00f7 5^{0} + 4|=; 10 \u00f7 1 + 4|=; 10 + 4|=; 14]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nCalculate [MATH: 10\\div 5^0 + (3^2-5).]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nTo evaluate the given expression, we use PEMDAS.\n\nFirst, we compute the expression inside the parentheses:\n\n[MATH: 10 \u00f7 5^{0} + (9 \u2212 5) = 10 \u00f7 5^{0} + 4]\n\nNext, notice that [MATH: 5^0=1.] So, we obtain:\n\n[MATH: 10 \u00f7 5^{0} + 4|=; 10 \u00f7 1 + 4|=; 10 + 4|=; 14]"
      },
