        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>What is the value of  <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\dfrac{4}{3} \\times (-5+3)^{-2} + \\dfrac{2}{3} ?]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "What is the value of [MATH: \\dfrac{4}{3} \\times (-5+3)^{-2} + \\dfrac{2}{3} ?]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>To evaluate the given expression, we use PEMDAS.</p><p>First, we compute the expression inside the parentheses:</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\dfrac{4}{3} \\times ({\\color{red}-5} + {\\color{red}3})^{-2} + \\dfrac{2}{3} = \\dfrac{4}{3} \\times ({\\color{red}-2})^{-2} + \\dfrac{2}{3}]</span></p><p>Next, notice that <span class=\"math\">[MATH: (-2)^{-2}=\\dfrac{1}{(-2)^2} = \\dfrac{1}{4}.]</span> So, we obtain:</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: (4)/(3) \u00d7 (\u2212 2)^{\u2212 2} + (2)/(3)|=; (4)/(3) \u00d7 (1)/(4) + (2)/(3)|=; (4 \u00d7 1)/(3 \u00d7 4) + (2)/(3)|=; (4 \u00d7 1)/(3 \u00d7 4) + (2)/(3)|=; (1)/(3) + (2)/(3)|=; 1]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "To evaluate the given expression, we use PEMDAS.\n\nFirst, we compute the expression inside the parentheses:\n\n[MATH: \\dfrac{4}{3} \\times ({\\color{red}-5} + {\\color{red}3})^{-2} + \\dfrac{2}{3} = \\dfrac{4}{3} \\times ({\\color{red}-2})^{-2} + \\dfrac{2}{3}]\n\nNext, notice that [MATH: (-2)^{-2}=\\dfrac{1}{(-2)^2} = \\dfrac{1}{4}.] So, we obtain:\n\n[MATH: (4)/(3) \u00d7 (\u2212 2)^{\u2212 2} + (2)/(3)|=; (4)/(3) \u00d7 (1)/(4) + (2)/(3)|=; (4 \u00d7 1)/(3 \u00d7 4) + (2)/(3)|=; (4 \u00d7 1)/(3 \u00d7 4) + (2)/(3)|=; (1)/(3) + (2)/(3)|=; 1]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
